From 3c01260f838919c624fb27c31b86e77e1afeddd8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SheepyLord <37598021+SheepyLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 07:58:20 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] VR: render a headset-sized centre view, warp and submit eyes,
 mirror and feed overlays

The module owns OpenVR. Keep the runtime output and preset in a device-scoped session, flush under DXVK queue exclusion, match queued camera poses, capture PNGs and publish pass timestamps. Enable five supported prerequisite extension names without loading OpenVR in flat sessions.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
